{"pre":{"id":"GH-03-pre-q3","type":"single","question":"研究位移函数 s(t)=t² 在 t=2 秒时的瞬时速度。取 t=1.5，1.8，1.9，2.1，2.2，2.5，算得相应区间端点与 t=2 之间的平均速度依次为 3.5，3.8，3.9，4.1，4.2，4.5 米/秒。随着时间间隔从两侧缩小，瞬时速度最可能是多少？","options":[{"value":"A","label":"2 米/秒"},{"value":"B","label":"4 米/秒"},{"value":"C","label":"4.5 米/秒"},{"value":"D","label":"不存在"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"左侧平均速度 3.5、3.8、3.9 与右侧平均速度 4.5、4.2、4.1 都在时间间隔缩小时趋近 4，因此瞬时速度为 4 米/秒。","points":8,"knowledgePointIds":["GH-03-K02"],"cognitiveLevel":"理解","estimatedSteps":3,"pairId":"P03","equivalence":{"presentationMode":"table","knownConditionCount":2,"operationCount":3,"symbolComplexity":"低","conclusionClass":"数值趋近判断"},"evidence":{"kind":"two-sided-table","targetX":2,"targetY":4,"correctOptionId":"B","rows":[{"x":1.5,"y":3.5},{"x":1.8,"y":3.8},{"x":1.9,"y":3.9},{"x":2.1,"y":4.1},{"x":2.2,"y":4.2},{"x":2.5,"y":4.5}]}},"post":{"id":"GH-03-post-q3","type":"single","question":"实验员以 τ=3 分钟为基准，分别缩短前后两侧的观测间隔。τ 值：2.5，2.8，2.9，3.1，3.2，3.5；相应平均变化率：5.5，5.8，5.9，6.1，6.2，6.5，单位均为 mol/(L·min)。哪一数值最能概括 τ=3 时的瞬时变化率？","options":[{"value":"A","label":"3 mol/(L·min)"},{"value":"B","label":"5.9 mol/(L·min)"},{"value":"C","label":"6 mol/(L·min)"},{"value":"D","label":"6.5 mol/(L·min)"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"左侧读数 5.5、5.8、5.9 与右侧按靠近顺序排列的 6.5、6.2、6.1 共同趋近 6，所以 C 正确。","points":8,"knowledgePointIds":["GH-03-K02"],"cognitiveLevel":"理解","estimatedSteps":3,"pairId":"P03","equivalence":{"presentationMode":"table","knownConditionCount":2,"operationCount":3,"symbolComplexity":"低","conclusionClass":"数值趋近判断"},"evidence":{"kind":"two-sided-table","targetX":3,"targetY":6,"correctOptionId":"C","rows":[{"x":2.5,"y":5.5},{"x":2.8,"y":5.8},{"x":2.9,"y":5.9},{"x":3.1,"y":6.1},{"x":3.2,"y":6.2},{"x":3.5,"y":6.5}]}}}
